{"ts":"2026-08-10T23:30:50.162Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"1afd4367fbbff62fc92ece2d","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-rl-qdxu"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"A registered seed cannot parent any candidate, and the tests hide it by writing outside the command surface"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"CodeRabbit review of pm-rl#12, Major. registerGeneration sets a seed's policy to the empty string, and every candidate's collection runs must carry component equal to the parent's policy. rl run start always sets a non-empty algorithm as the component, so EVERY candidate parented to a freshly registered seed is refused with run_policy_mismatch, and no command ever sets the seed's policy afterward.\n\nThe reviewer found why the suite is nonetheless green: the test helper giveSeedPolicy rewrites the seed body through a raw client.update, STEPPING OUTSIDE THE COMMAND SURFACE. The tests prove the internals work while the product does not - a green suite over an unusable end-to-end path.\n\nFix by accepting a policy for the seed registration, or by skipping the run-policy check when the parent is a seed with no recorded policy. The regression test must parent a candidate to a seed using ONLY published commands, with no raw client writes."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-10T23:30:50.162Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-10T23:30:50.162Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"59610665c84e1d4491b6853cfad3a22262b2a098f28a89904ceb7ac3ff005c39","message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
